  m_GameObject: {fileID: 224954161}
  m_Text: "Debris blasts down the hall in bursts\nand the floor ahead is broken.
    Duck\nbehind the shield panel when the lights\nflash, push it along (or B steers
    it \u2014\nhold Right Shift), and jump the gaps\nbetween bursts."
